# Cloudflare Pages natively serves clean URLs:
#   /transfer       → serves transfer.html (no redirect needed)
#   /transfer.html  → 308 canonical redirect to /transfer (CF does this automatically)
#
# Adding manual redirects here for these routes creates a redirect loop.
# This file is intentionally minimal — only add rules CF cannot handle natively.
#
# ?sid= query strings pass through to static files transparently (no rule needed).
